<title>USA: Cincinnati Bell offers odd-lot program.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Bell offers odd-lot program.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cincinnati Bell Inc said on Tuesday shareowners with fewer than 100 Cincinnati Bell common shares will be able to sell their shares or round up to a 100-share position under a program offered by Fifth Third Bank.</p>
<p>Cincinnati Bell said the bank will send information this week to about 6,000 Cincinnati Bell shareowners eligible to participate.</p>
</text>
